menu "ModESP Sequence Engine"

    config MODESP_MAX_SEQUENCES
        int "Maximum concurrent scenario instances"
        range 1 8
        default 2
        help
            Number of slots в SequenceEngine pool. Each slot holds one
            loaded scenario (recipe). Per-slot static cost:
              - Buffer: MODESP_MODR_MAX_SIZE bytes (default 4 KB)
              - Runtime: ~600 bytes (state machine, dirty tracking)
            Total per slot: ~MODESP_MODR_MAX_SIZE + 1 KB.

            Default 2 = 2 concurrent scenarios. Bump only якщо ви маєте
            real use case (e.g. multiple zones running independent recipes
            у parallel). Each +1 slot costs ~5 KB RAM (із default sizes).

    config MODESP_MODR_MAX_SIZE
        int "Maximum .modr recipe binary size (bytes)"
        range 1024 32768
        default 4096
        help
            Pre-allocated buffer size per slot. Determines maximum recipe
            complexity (phases × tracks × actions × params) що fits.

            Typical sizes:
              - Minimal recipe (1 track, 1 phase): ~120 bytes
              - 2-track sync recipe: ~250 bytes
              - 3-phase abstract test (2 tracks): ~760 bytes
              - Complex 5-phase × 4-track із many actions: ~2-4 KB

            Default 4 KB covers most realistic recipes із headroom. Bump
            до 16 KB only якщо recipe author confirms size requirement.
            Larger value = more RAM used (4 KB × MODESP_MAX_SEQUENCES static).

endmenu
